%% HAND-CURATED. State machine fallback per sys-03 §4 + §10.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Device
    participant RealtimeService
    participant ConfigService

    Note over Device: state=LISTENING or THINKING — WS attempts or heartbeat fail
    Device->>RealtimeService: WS handshake attempt
    alt ws_connect_failure (E-RT-301)
        RealtimeService--xDevice: timeout or refused
        Device->>Device: schedule job_reconnect_attempt (RAM timer wheel, exponential 2s→5m)
    end

    Device->>ConfigService: POST /v1/devices/heartbeat (cadence 60s)
    alt heartbeat_failure_persistent (10 consecutive failures)
        ConfigService--xDevice: 5xx or network timeout
        Device->>Device: state=OFFLINE_LIMITED — touch-triggered canned responses, limited LED/display
    end

    Note over Device: load /runtime/offline/manifest.json
    alt no_valid_manifest
        Device->>Device: silent-limited mode (visual cues only)
    else offline_manifest_expired
        Device->>Device: continue using last valid content + emit warning telemetry
    else success
        Device->>Device: play canned offline_entry phrase
    end

    loop reconnect attempts (job_reconnect_attempt)
        Device->>RealtimeService: WS handshake attempt (backoff window)
        alt reconnect_success
            RealtimeService-->>Device: 101 session ready
            Device->>Device: health check — config etag still valid, no fault active
            alt health_ok
                Device->>Device: state=IDLE_READY · play reconnect_success local phrase
            else health_fail
                Device->>Device: remain in OFFLINE_LIMITED
            end
        end
    end

    Note over Device,ConfigService: timeout 5s WS · deferred jobs may not allocate over 8KB heap · drop non-critical jobs before safety jobs on timer-wheel overload
